      <comment>avoid redir on tv series</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''King of the Hill''' may refer to:

* [[King of the Hill (TV series)]], the Mike Judge animated television series.
* [[King of the Hill (game)]], a game where the object is to stay on top of a large hill or pile.
* [[King of the Hill (film)]], a 1993 Steven Soderbergh film.
* [[King of the Hill (The Simpsons episode)]], an episode of ''The Simpsons'' from the ninth season.
* [[King of the Hill (board game)]], a [[tabletop game]] manufactured by Schaper Toys.

{{disambig}}</text>
    </revision>
