      <comment>/* Southbound */ dab [[Interstate 580 (California)]]</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">{{routeboxint|article_route=238
|route_type=reg
|type=Auxiliary
|direction_a=South
|direction_b=North
|terminus_a=[[Image:California State Route 238.svg|25px]] [[California State Route 238|CA-238]] in [[Castro Valley, CA]]
|terminus_b=[[Image:Interstate 880 (California).svg|25px]] [[I-880 (CA)|I-880]] in [[San Lorenzo, CA]]
|length_mi=2.23
|length_km=3.59
|year_established=1983
|junction=[[Image:Interstate 580 (California).svg|25px]] [[I-580 (CA)|I-580]] in [[Castro Valley, CA]]
|shield_ext= (California)
}}

'''Interstate 238''' (abbreviated '''I-238''') is a short (2.23 mi/3.59 km) [[Interstate Highway]] in the [[San Francisco Bay Area]], [[California]], USA. Its western terminus is at [[Interstate 880|I-880]] in [[San Lorenzo, California|San Lorenzo]] and its east end as an Interstate highway is at [[Interstate 580 (California)|I-580]] in [[Castro Valley, California]].  From there it continues south as [[California State Route 238]]. I-238 is the only three-digit Interstate that does not have a two-digit &quot;parent&quot;; there is no Interstate 38 (and even if there were, it would go well south of the Bay Area). The number was chosen by [[Caltrans]], who wanted an Interstate for part of CA 238, but at the time there was no available number for a &quot;child&quot; of [[Interstate 80|I-80]] (280 to 980 were in use, and there is a [[California State Route 180|CA 180]]). [[Interstate 480 (California)|I-480]] is now free thanks to the demolition of the [[Embarcadero Freeway]].

==List of exits==
The following is a list of exits along Interstate 238.

===Northbound===
'''Exit 15'''- [[California State Route 185|CA 185]], Mission Blvd.

'''Exit 16A'''- [[Interstate 880|I-880 South]]

'''Exit 16B'''- Springlake Dr.; Hesperian Blvd.

'''Exit 17A'''- Washington Ave.

'''Exit 17B'''- [[Interstate 880|I-880 North]]

===Southbound===
'''Exit 15'''- [[California State Route 185|CA 185]], Mission Blvd.

'''Exit 14C'''- Foothill Blvd.; Mattox Rd.

'''Exit 14B'''- [[Interstate 580 (California)|I-580 North]]

'''Exit 14A'''- [[Interstate 580 (California)|I-580 South]]

*All exits on I-238 are not numbered

*Exit number reference- [http://www.dot.ca.gov/hq/traffops/signtech/calnexus/ Cal-NEXUS]

==State Law==
'''Legal Definition of Route 238:''' [http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/California_Streets_and_Highways_Code%2C_Chapter_2%2C_Article_3%2C_Section_301-635#Route_238 California Streets and Highways Code, Chapter 2, Article 3, Section 538]
{{CAFES|shield=Interstate blank.svg|route=238|sec=253.1}}

==See also==
