|image           = ALetterToThreeWives.jpg
|caption         = (Left to right) Darnell, Sothern and Crain
|director        = [[Joseph L. Mankiewicz]]
|producer        = [[Sol C. Siegel]]
|writer          = [[John Klempner]] (novel)&lt;br/&gt;[[Vera Caspary]]&lt;br/&gt;[[Joseph L. Mankiewicz]]
|starring        = [[Jeanne Crain]]&lt;br/&gt;[[Linda Darnell]]&lt;br/&gt;[[Ann Sothern]]&lt;br/&gt;[[Kirk Douglas]]&lt;br/&gt;[[Paul Douglas (actor)|Paul Douglas]]
