* {{moby game|id=/dig|name=''The Dig''}}
* [http://lucasarts.vintagegaming.org/index.php?do=game&amp;gameid=12 LucasArts Museum]
* [http://www.billtiller.com/projects/dig.asp Bill Tiller's Gallery of ''The Dig'' Background Art]
* [http://home.comcast.net/~ervind/ ATMachine's House of LucasArts Oddities]
* [http://home.comcast.net/~ervind/digstuff/digtext1.html The Dig development history at LucasArts Oddities]
* [http://soundtracks.mixnmojo.com/dig.htm The Dig: Complete Soundtrack by Michael Land, available free for download]

