[[William Holden]] ''as'' Paul Verrall&lt;br&gt;
[[Howard St. John]] ''as'' Jim Devery&lt;br&gt;
[[Frank Otto]] ''as'' Eddie&lt;br&gt;
[[Larry Oliver]] ''as'' Congressman Norval Hedges&lt;br&gt;
[[Barbara Brown]] ''as'' Mrs. Hedges&lt;br&gt;
[[Grandon Rhodes]] ''as'' Sanborn&lt;br&gt;
[[Claire Carleton]] ''as'' Helen&lt;br&gt;

== 1993 film ==
''Born Yesterday'' was remade in [[1993]] starring [[Melanie Griffith]], [[John Goodman]] and [[Don Johnson]].  It was adapted by Douglas McGrath and directed by Luis Mandoki.

