[[371 BC]] [[370 BC]] [[369 BC]] [[368 BC]] [[367 BC]] - '''366 BC''' - [[365 BC]] [[364 BC]] [[363 BC]] [[362 BC]] [[361 BC]]
----

===Events===
* In [[Persian Empire|Persia]], [[satrap]]s of [[Artaxerxes II]] begin a revolt that lasts until [[358 BC]].
* [[Dion of Syracuse|Dion]] is expelled from [[Syracuse, Italy|Syracuse]].
* [[Plato]] arrives in Syracuse on Dion's invitation, leaves the next year.
* The [[Greece|Greek]] city of [[Thebes, Greece|Thebes]] captures the city [[Oropus]].
* [[Athens]] founds the town of Kos on the island of [[Kos]] in the [[Aegean Sea]].

